{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1295,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc6ce5db9bd671d4641603ee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯……晚上好像有点冷。\r\n训练员，把你的衣服借给我。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d30081e752a6be94611070f5f9c9beedc88fe64114775e909706846b64474c4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7078cb11aa86e98690f0bce5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我完成了将海浪声转换为电流\r\n来刺激脑部的「绝对好眠装置」！\r\n记得明天前写份报告交上来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e6a31ddc6c194b4d9cb4149023993286161e328820fd4459bb5a3a7140b17f1c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:873742726bbda82d2fa19e84",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "春天真不错，能够让我感受到\r\n生命那强烈的气息呢。话虽如此，\r\n我穿成这样真的会感冒吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "5bc5b3105fe27cb2c717d8ed254f6294e7a5d5b6679f318917181a8e1d47acec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:41255ece80865e04ac85e747",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就算是日照不强的日子也不能大意。\r\n对了，我来帮你涂个好东西吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "57606a7e6140a2c98aa3f62cd2e4355434a77429bf539dc8e4fd188d2ae6eca8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21532febf1871c961b04856c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然我喜欢足不出户，\r\n但露营也挺不错的呢。\r\n在河边做实验别有一番乐趣吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea89696e2bf940b0233179b4b9e4dd397cbdee1d8bb868106ad5b315e92db61a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:688c0f2e2b8d38435d34a080",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "刚刚泳池里的水竟然是冰的啦……\r\n我是不是应该让自己\r\n能够自由调整肤觉呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1fb3ee129caafc5d4a5f2ae45185f73616da58b39cf136f41d815a160bce7c36",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ba1af1b23a555ffd682c739",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "甜食日快乐呢",
      "source_fingerprint": "20b111871325bbd27191659b6fe14d416c2d3f4dfb4e9914b81e3531b81c2add",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1d1fec5e1785fc87ea701c4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "甜食日快乐呢",
      "source_fingerprint": "20b111871325bbd27191659b6fe14d416c2d3f4dfb4e9914b81e3531b81c2add",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0491f0f088992126716cd7fe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "実にいい朝だ！僅かな眠気を、\r\n那由他の彼方へ押しやる1杯の\r\n紅茶があれば、なおいいのだが？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a66520caea97f6f00c95eea7b7cdef9a01fa8180aadb2ffec41ad78702d2d1cf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "90210"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7502656cc38ce2874923eb75",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夜半から日の出まで起きていると\r\n徹夜になるなら…日の出にあわせて\r\n仮眠をとればセーフじゃないかい？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1faf63f4630642177c9a9dd14aa71863f8dc006dae6b259b2ee62e4c4cd4af3f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "90211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:100d82108347e04403319623",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "脳が栄養を求めている。さぁ、\r\n早急に補給しておくれ！世界に\r\n大きな損失が発生してしまうよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2b3bcab0271bd615e4d96db9085850063e8eb198f57a5edbd191730dc542f7a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "90212"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fac72462436e58c5956790e5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ランチはカフェでとるといい！\r\nどの道、君の机に資料を広げていて\r\n使えるスペースがないからね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "90cf1128d4b122f12e67d4b2ef3841fd12ccff6b8a0d9c774c8cb95f802122ca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "90213"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35fe728f6a7eea153edddcbe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "こんな時間にまで会いに来るとは、\r\n君のモルモット精神は評価に値する\r\nおかげで眠気も消えてしまったよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c72761482cc458393813fdddc6a16851f6fd5e313962e39f078d51cce4f3d42",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "90214"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cfdbc708a2039a9153e035df",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "日も暮れたのに溌剌な生徒たちだ…\r\n全員研究に値する対象だよ！\r\nさ、一緒に観察しようじゃないか！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b2c2e2653b344ac90eae39b9ef29d6d7b80792e793a5496188cfc839c065432",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "90215"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:863782ab901b89aab98018f4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "この時期は新しい研究材料…\r\nもとい、新入生を迎える時期。\r\n実に心躍る季節だねぇ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "33ad3f3f6e7b898a7979123a53181373b3105806d3736bffb52502b946a6e884",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "90216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07c478f5d9ee765e5412098d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "カフェの近くにいると体感温度が\r\n下がる瞬間があってね…どうにか\r\n意図的に発動できないものか…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d3836c346624c1ce79eaa9377422d97a75d10c0f66f701898ec240bfd34b730",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "90217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:87ee9e1902cceeff287b08bc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "食欲、運動、読書…とくれば、\r\n実験の秋でも構わないだろう！\r\nさ、横になってくれたまえ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7538f641e2cc672b035b2a9b38b2bde6e2f2d484e694582a222b7ace188ee55b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "90218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d6d66f739509de9b0751ed3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "寒さがいかに走りに影響を\r\n与えるか…実験には比較が必要。\r\nとはいえ体を冷やすのは…酷だね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2cf2c8e24cbcd8c4512f1e9e9985ace09562f875d9ea3708e8b5bc84877c766",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "90219"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bcc6526ce75547c7627deca5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ハッピー甘味物の日だねぇ",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca47e01f600f8fceb2caa26be716209f9320b120858ff231598d3bf3bfcd3db2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "90221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca7fb3a85d32f93dea08122b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就算我想偷偷做实验，\r\n也总是会被茶座发现…\r\n嗯…她难道有什么特殊能力吗。",
      "source_fingerprint": "88137bd026471f4765d9438729aa3b58e98fb1c58b307eb815e43dab81ff1d30",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c67658717736d62cd89582e6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "速子虽然指『超光速粒子』…\r\n但我所向往的目标，\r\n还在那更前方。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2fecbd3ad0877e35130e73afac257cc2bfc5878e29c233162d86cedb826a8a86",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2bc0215e82a643fa09c7c249",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然我平时都是个观察者…\r\n但和数码君在一起的话，就能了解到\r\n被观察者的心情，感觉很新鲜哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6495944e8a6a4fb867715303d9d28a3cc85cbb2a31a95efc436838f49507fb38",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76af2b63b146c491e7a68504",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没有比服用兴奋剂更无趣的行为了。\r\n我所追求的是永恒的速度…\r\n药物不过是探寻可能性的道具罢了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1d5f052568fdfb9343877fabce176f87617660a4d8e386fb701dc05b6fe1a4d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17ea078d6914e49bc58da479",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的家人基本上都秉持着放任主义呢。\r\n也多亏他们，我从小时候起\r\n就能够专心于研究了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb72fc77993cacab242709655ea94264c277f6b9b3eb61f399f9d23c369c0135",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1dc9e4a3d52d8307715b956",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我想把存储介质装在衣服上来着…\r\n但不知道能否改造至\r\n在舞台上不会暴露的程度呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b48cb4d628d468ecea8cec64802e6a746be5f6ba380c6ee2aa465496a32308a2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe4d1998f83a86ecb9654f1f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要一边观察着舞台上的马娘们\r\n还要一边跳舞…收集数据\r\n也是很辛苦的啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dfc503593023c8b551a2d18a949f67184e956b6be0e06baf844de8a475c6dfa7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52b3d971d84d0dc712b1e051",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "令人心情高涨的服装呢。\r\n穿上它，在比赛中也能\r\n顺利进行实验…桀桀。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee60af564d98fe75c53d9bbf8a7aec98a83501d6548a0c68215053666da85927",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:684a834ba6f6ea844db7aeeb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "探求之心是没有尽头的。\r\n也是无论何时都不会消失的。\r\n这件衣服就是其具现化的存在哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ef6378add964da47da02975fc545e487067c5e1a93e47634842eaebe0db4188",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aee131ce3142f87194d43e7b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我真是太喜欢你迷迷糊糊的样子了。\r\n没什么深层含义哦。\r\n仅仅是方便我做实验罢了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f403e58d5247a376ead2ae3f87eaebdd9738c743bce2c39ac35517ea3ef92c40",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8f2a9873ffc441a6717f77a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员君，午睡要提前\r\n跟我打个招呼哦。\r\n我做了各种各样的准备呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "026d034edfb69a18600b3d29fb79a9a69108eb919b8f9da6e724e6ed3e4ac893",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3cbc2a853b804f7e0c4beeac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "与其去喝咖啡提神，\r\n倒不如来陪我做实验，\r\n提神效果更佳哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e7b9571bcfb2a8bfbaf4f945eb43de51574ea74c9e81517b4bcd7a9b4a49e73",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c953b7d0c5f4fd64bb3b9341",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有种说法，蝴蝶的鳞粉具有\r\n减弱空气阻力的能力。\r\n…你，要不要敷在腿上试试？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4aee538a0ff6056dc5d5440dab6e339ba7541a193829dcfa4da8dde31ea0f02f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f531aa93e1434ade5e29ff4b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员君，要时刻保持房间内的凉爽哦？\r\n因为夏季的炎热会令我的思考能力\r\n严重下降呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "79c5a98d0fb3298c2a54fbb686af05ad30875d22e1e5cd4163d3bcbffa38b775",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e40987dd1012fdb3a8e12cdd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有种好办法可以度过漫长秋夜…\r\n喂，不要在我说出来之前\r\n就开始警戒啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c7078735eabedc06037e3ed00f2d657f5e80a481054b152ccd67ab4e2046d5c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9abdfd00978164ede80de566",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "抵抗寒冷需要将受体细胞…\r\n不对，要从根本上解决的话…阿嚏！\r\n呜呜，暖气开得还是太早了吗…",
      "source_fingerprint": "c661efa2a11d99f8eb739e6e80239df1b5a71550c524d343e47f994114cd2167",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9e1c91ab37f9c4e5f0ed0c6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "飞鹰子好像想要一件可爱又\r\n引人注目的泳装。帮她加上\r\n萤火虫那种发光物质好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fed0f1c0fab07ce0ddc273e0030089b6f0260de402790d2047c7baa9240b6cb2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49bc22a1f7c8773991519814",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赤骥很认真，所以我就来送她个\r\n「能够放松身心和骨骼的\r\n仿真度假装置」吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d41ebfd85edefd5a966e3c7a3584107676729aa9df2a732d214fe038167beed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a665884e2ff368e712b662c9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "铃鹿喃喃说着「想要迈向\r\n水平线的彼端」……好，我来把她的\r\n肉体改造成能够在水面上跑步吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff53717f398b302250bcf6ba9a12e66589b49297ef4689ecc5b32bdfc3480b68",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f945532f9c716406ccc30aca",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "变革很在意我腰间……\r\n佩带着的试管。或许能拿这当诱饵，\r\n钓到她来当实验对象……",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d6cc6d9929e17ddf78cf47950d823858bcbd5c474b6136594fc468d1a9eae6e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:732bcc5d88a85264d52ed4ec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "数码流鼻血了。\r\n不晓得是不是\r\n克氏静脉丛有问题？",
      "source_fingerprint": "77301268e60c282f8d09ec49aa753aec7f72d7a00c12b530835cdaab9df4a222",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2421f2b4968511a103c4a1ee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好啦，今天要采什么好呢？\r\n药草、矿石，还是赛马娘……\r\n嗯……真叫人烦恼。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3cbee3c745a9eec78b676bb6c4daaf1ccc4a355a463c0074c6b6c5f5298feb52",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5096145dddc3c0a614ae13e7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你有留心要配合餐点\r\n摄取足够的水分吗？\r\n如果不够，我这里有好东西。",
      "source_fingerprint": "644f6b55887f76c5ec7924ea882fe4b714f6844679cad1c7f66d2b581f6033c3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40e8b0b7e128ae3914517fc4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "海洋、生命的诞生……\r\n最初诞生的赛马娘是经历了\r\n进化过程而来的吗？又或者……",
      "source_fingerprint": "93924ac6e612314aeb82846e0c083912ab20ab64157d46062413665499eb3cba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:234968e731f7fef8f3191393",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我在海边有什么就采什么，\r\n结果搞得研究室像贝冢一样……\r\n拜托你想办法处理一下吧～",
      "source_fingerprint": "a6562e721c991543f9881c3958ff7c6f03e50bab95efea932ed2c305993478cc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d51fb19eccd9055ce74f3dc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "透过日光促进生成维他命D……\r\n若我利用改良防晒乳的方式制作，\r\n应该就不缺实验对象了吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c11871c980cdfc82b069293b8c31529fed0eba755cb3945b6a565255ce672d05",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:391fe0939c46af6606a5f3e6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "收获的季节到来了呢。\r\n真希望我的研究，\r\n也能有亮眼的收获啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e2c21487c3cb224a54637615d532d109ee550b4b1ee6d069487108255e87c9d5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb03433a483bd18c156f280d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好冷好冷好冷好冷啊──！\r\n训练员！你既然身为我的助手，\r\n就陪我一起穿泳装度日啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7bd1abf0de7122cbc81f0c5603197efb9707537017f104869fbbdfc1db6f1507",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb6b302dd47c506843fee6f9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "咦？你说我腰际有东西在动？\r\n你多心了吧。这里只有树果、\r\n花朵和小奇而已哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab991c8ee25f1fc9d4ef20bae0481d136ee0c336492ab9ca81138ac127004d94",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d80f6ddb3ca64186f2d2529d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "手套是采药草不可或缺的装备。\r\n毕竟有很多药草若是徒手碰触\r\n会十分危险呢……呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3188c5834936293b367457a4e6ed6d0fa7ce9370574937154c581d28eb2e12ae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d2fd27d993af31b4180876db",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "研究室で実験していると上着がずり\r\n落ちても、そのたびカフェか誰かに\r\n直してもらえて、便利なんだよねぇ",
      "source_fingerprint": "029931568f2a97dfc74d094a1dd6d775e456a63bbe4025d748e0d9d9b364c9ec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "91216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8eaf4df7909e38f318aad7ed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ポッケ君…ああ、ポッケ君！\r\nこれまでも、これからも――いい\r\n研究対象として励んでくれたまえ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5628530b80cd2bcc80ca77cd18acc4e0bf3e435e73b20d4dc4d28720e32f3cd3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "91217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d75586de818f6ebd3bf8716",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "興味深いとは言ったが…走りに対し\r\nてであってだね。オペラに興味が\r\nあるわけではないのだが…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1da603b0a3491d154480492fa8e796af660d446379c7338274688f3cd0acac5b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "91218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e2e2dd77633dbce614513d3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ダンツ君には感謝しているんだ！\r\nいつも研究資料や材料の運搬を嫌な\r\n顔せず手伝ってくれるからねぇ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff9714b703a4d83fa6cefc0f4e19c39cfd91d7c6f6e4a0f08ac9f4179c10c170",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "91219"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c90b1158f2fd963ba0d851d1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最近、私を見るスカーレット君の\r\n目が生物発光さながらに輝いて\r\nいてね…全く、興味深い子だよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "08a4542cc9f22191cc068faa79477aa91f10847f135b1b6366c2274d692168e2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "91220"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a67f3b015c285c549901f22",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "眠気覚ましに特別なお茶を用意して\r\nあげたよ！…なんだい、今日こそは\r\n普通のお茶さ！失礼だなー君は！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c6f71e11f546cddab674fb7fe5a68bf97d30a0be9b9b24b14eed3cec85307d3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "91221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8c2c4fdb9b5a62fb265f88fb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "昼食は3分で済ませたまえ。休み\r\n時間すらトレーニングに費やす者\r\nたちの観察に行こうじゃないか！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef216bd0ba0085dadf6a4a98f7a4d2c3421e93a7b73da082a3d022d406c6cb8e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "91222"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cca49461e0ea8e9c6826251b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "カフェインがいかに体に影響を及ぼ\r\nすか…カフェが飲んだコーヒーは\r\n今日も計測済み。結果が楽しみだ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5967d6a2fbf4b55fbd69aa486f452ff0e0261607a264f3e0118368765716e0b7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "91223"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94211a5d561f847a6e64c3af",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "始まりの季節だね。研究も一新して\r\nみようか…ククッ、安心したまえ。\r\nモルモット君を代えはしないさ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "45c293ea7ee1b5e74a6c6d9440a2593d698654279465a5e3c2f01bd31a089699",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "91224"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d5c4d67d591f376f597975b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夏は急成長するウマ娘が多い…。\r\nつまり、研究しがいのある時期\r\nというわけだ！滾ってきたねぇ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d152a9deb2e2196e6d1f3a520e95c4a74a28b896a6a6d5a22e5a2002d008d3d1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "91225"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9126daa58f8c91b08968a18a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "図書室の資料はいいものだよ。\r\n最近のレース情報も入っていてね。\r\n物好きが多くて助かるよ、ここは。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a86b2b8dbd201cdc7198f66d9ab90a2008da23ac48b0b4049165ff80047b2c7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "91226"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:32dc92e873e323bccbc44193",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "外に観察に行く時は熱いお茶を\r\n持っていくんだが…気づいたら\r\n冷めていてね。君、いるかい？",
      "source_fingerprint": "bde95e2d77816eaf0292d6204590f2a297ae43ae871de66956222cf4fb5a4109",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "91227"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4a90e7eee08acf606ef4a78",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "実証の時だ…白衣からこの衣装\r\nへの変貌は、つまりそういうこと。\r\n研究はひと休みというわけだ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "91476cb3295ee0dae6694309c84dc27e6f781fbb19899a4be8357691ad69809e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "91228"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5b867459bc3c2ce6ef281646",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "興味深い研究結果を得たんだ…。\r\n当然利用させてもらったよ。\r\nこの衣装にね！アーッハッハッハ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c3b7f3562f23f807e7798bb391fdcb3b08a5eab6e4175ad4032a68785523e01",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "91229"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:36caa18b705fcb6b329b1ccb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "接下来该做什么好呢。\r\n要不要把微丝\r\n拧三圈试试？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f59c1427a8a9bb9cd769385a66b6305a9c741d54156a4327ad41155a14c1c19c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3acf2dc9daf779e04f35daa5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行くとしよう",
      "source_fingerprint": "a7479c0afde79aaaf999ebd5e27c32168804477e7c84255a630384eb2f78eb80",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa0a1c336ac438f3358c7b38",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "积累与反复，对训练\r\n和研究来讲同样重要！\r\n来，开始吧！实验的日常！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5839163c261ca93255637f7578cbbe47580cfb3c5504393e0b9d74f3fb4a83c9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3c6a2f582fa45043215d637",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯，我想偷偷尝试的东西完成了。\r\n训练员君，总之先开始吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5bb7bcbfc144811adee585d26f7f7c057571dde465c1fca4a1624d5755cf0a2f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52177eefc11e4994e5f6a0e8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "既然要做就要坚持到底。\r\n就算好奇心会害死猫，\r\n也比无视可能性要好得多啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce57d652016c9dc33dc35aba1f8f989094d0fe1a5bbb8933fc7b25517b8d99cd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:325829ef3da6c22f64759375",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯…今天从什么做起呢。\r\n训练员君，你有什么建议吗？\r\n说出来我参考一下。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a850befc0cffb632ec8df3da0937a21956722d0f77d1e10d13b8834857b871c8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ceea43ed29fb81e8f160f6a9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没什么好烦恼的。不论结果如何，\r\n都能有所收获。\r\n果断下决定吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "364737500bc86c0da380e042138c316cd052e465ce630de437121309ed988d95",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb719da853e464cf483b466b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员君，今天的训练\r\n打算怎么安排呢？\r\n来交换一下意见吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "585187c12319f61926914675e49e0532907b72f9bdfe32e145482d47576cf3e4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:243df9cb163ec4bc185a2247",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我已经做好准备了，\r\n你呢？要喝点速子特制\r\n营养饮料吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8527af868fb1feaa6a2d7b4be4520e6259fb2da996f559377b3f68ef31461223",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d4cd36c0536b344a35fab724",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不晓得有没有\r\n刺激探求心的崭新发现呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b8a0c24cd7c7e37de18426254f327780b5a1d325135a8baf0ad588f8e0475183",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c0c96034437e4c00597c4fa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们去追寻可能性\r\n那遥远无比的尽头吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8bf944e8fe38a39ec861d1d7697be15c73a4823bfc03b7669dcd6fbe0fb88b25",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b72953202bbca93913ed87a9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "希望我采取的东西\r\n对实验有帮助。",
      "source_fingerprint": "41da9b2a3a68863d7dde6af717701d6c921ad830cd7e8f7b08e5d821352a7151",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07144fe6de208e704675f641",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀，小奇，你安静点。\r\n……嗯？不，跟你没关系。\r\n来，我们开始训练吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e96686ceeb281bb473c5781ab9ff212b6c266504edf0b6e588c3ef105ad5d6ed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a9601e3bfa4e0bc0e530751",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯……这个布料面积\r\n让人有点不太放心呢。\r\n训练员，你觉得呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "dad652fe519128e9551a8cb1d2d16b53dffb688553d345b0338383a4d73b0361",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b94da23227264d27a3b8aef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "偶尔也让我来照顾你吧！\r\n首先是喝增强肌肉的热带水果特调，\r\n好好消除你的身体疲劳！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b9634b93e64a76e7c25ff087c1c2c60e4f58bb2c0e95b6d73affb5a9212a491",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ad528f394ffd8f1cc3dc5fb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即使在无人踏足过的地方遇难，\r\n感觉有你在就能船到桥头自然直……\r\n嗯，真是奇妙。",
      "source_fingerprint": "128619311b85ab38aed9bf178ada4195170099e6668668bcbc514502a3dbd8d5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
